From 05f25b30a12c673240203bc51219072a7c882dd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:13:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add basic, semi-functional Flatpak with minimal basic dependency capture and host execution
---
